om%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1512x851+0+468/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F31%2Fc6%2F943e79104125b078e54170b51430%2Fimg-3148.jpg" class="img" alt="Bavarian breakfast that’s meat and carb heavy — and not for the faint of heart." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Bavarian breakfast that's meat and carb heavy — and not for the faint of heart.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Esme Nicholson/NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;A new NPR series is taking readers and listeners to breakfast tables around the world. In Munich, Germany, a Bavarian breakfast typically consists of boiled veal sausage, sweet mustard and a giant pretzel, all washed down with beer. Demetrios Kyriakides, who spent a year researching Bavarian breakfast joints in Munich, says the ambiance of &lt;em&gt;Gemütlichkeit&lt;/em&gt;, which describes conviviality, is just as important as the food. A meal is often accompanied by brass oom-pah-pah music. This feast is usually finished before the church bells ring at midday, signaling that all good things must come to an end. Check out these &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/08/09/nx-s1-5900954/in-munich-its-never-too-early-for-a-breakfast-beer-with-sausage-and-pretzels" target="_blank"&gt;photos of breakfast in Munich&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145427" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 8513;         --source-height: 4789;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8513x4789+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcc%2Fd1%2Ffa4b1b924ec1bf39ac5045218b42%2Fdth-company-artist-alexandra-hutchinson-in-firebird-credit-nir-arieli-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Dance Theatre of Harlem dancer stars in the titular role for the company&amp;#039;s revival of its 1982 Firebird production, wearing a costume designed by the late Geoffrey Holder." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Dance Theatre of Harlem dancer stars in the titular role for the company's revival of its 1982 &lt;em&gt;Firebird&lt;/em&gt; production, wearing a costume designed by the late Geoffrey Holder.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Nir Arieli/Dance Theatre of Harlem                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;ol class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Under artistic director Robert Garland, Dance Theatre of Harlem is embarking on a new era by &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/01/nx-s1-5968450/dance-theatre-of-harlem-robert-garland" target="_blank"&gt;reviving its landmark 1982 production&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;em&gt;Firebird&lt;/em&gt; for an international tour.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Biologists at the University of Massachusetts Amherst have found what &lt;a href="https://www.wbur.org/news/2026/09/29/umass-amherst-worlds-loudest-birds-bellbird-seriema?utm_source=npr.org&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=national_highlight&amp;utm_content=homepage" target="_blank"&gt;may potentially be the world's loudest birds&lt;/a&gt;, and they all live in Brazil. (via &lt;a href="https://www.wbur.org/" target="_blank"&gt;WBUR&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scientist Olivia Sanderfoot wants to establish a &lt;a href="http://npr.org/2026/10/06/nx-s1-5991854/wildfire-smoke-ecology-birds-wildlife-health" target="_blank"&gt;new field called "smoke ecology,"&lt;/a&gt; which studies the effects of wildfire smoke on wildlife and seeks ways to mitigate its impacts.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This newsletter was edited by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/people/859721331/suzanne-nuyen"target="_blank"   &gt;&lt;em&gt;Suzanne Nuyen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
